:DECLARE nCount :DEFAULT 0; writes the default inline on the :DECLARE
statement. v0.24.0 reported diag.default_on_declare_line here; the
re-scoped rule only inspects statement-initial :DEFAULT targets, and the
statement now validates clean under every profile.
Known issue: #323 (regression: this input should not validate clean).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE StartCount;
	:DECLARE nCount :DEFAULT 0;
	nCount := nCount + 1;
	:RETURN nCount;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE StartCount;
	:DECLARE nCount :DEFAULT 0;

	nCount := nCount + 1;

	:RETURN nCount;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
